  "question": {
    "text": "If both the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are positive, then the complete solution set of real values of <math><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Both roots are positive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Sum of the roots,&nbsp;<math><mi>S</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Product of roots,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Discriminant,&nbsp;<math><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0060_9c468cf96e6b.png\" style=\"width:4.03403in;height:1.04028in\" /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> or <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />Taking intersection we get <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  }
